message: "If you reference Project S.P.H.E.R.E., Protocol LOC-1, or the Version 2.0 Technical Whitepaper, please cite the relevant controlled record below."
title: "Project S.P.H.E.R.E.: Open Resonance Metrology, Experimental Controls, and Accountable Research Infrastructure (Whitepaper v2.0 & Public Portal)"
type: dataset
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
