abstract: >-
  Project S.P.H.E.R.E. (Spatial Positioning Harmonic Empirical Resonance Experiment) is a
  staged experimental research program designed to subject unconventional or source-inspired
  hypotheses to conventional scientific measurement, metrology, uncertainty analysis,
  adversarial controls, preregistration, reproducible analysis, fresh confirmation, and
  independent replication. Version 2.0 supersedes Version 1.0 (Zenodo DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.23583932) while retaining the immutable OSF Protocol LOC-1 registration
  (https://osf.io/5b6mj/overview) as the governing Phase 1 baseline. Pre-results; no
  experimental measurements or findings are reported.
